## Global orchestrator (optional)

The Major agent at `~/.agents/AGENTS.md` (route.yaml + subagents) classifies intent and
delegates to specialist subagents (`coder`, `debugger`, `reviewer`, `researcher`,
`tester`, `doc-writer`, `architect`). Use it when this project's rules need to be combined
with cross-tool routing.
